<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">imi wa nai no sa</font></b></font></font></font>

35
00:01:12,890 --> 00:01:13,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:34,690 --> 00:01:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...bring it to an end swiftly!</font>

39
00:01:38,200 --> 00:01:39,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do anything.</font>

40
00:01:40,370 --> 00:01:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First move, a surefire victory!</font>

41
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wow! That's amazing!</font>

42
00:01:58,720 --> 00:02:00,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with his body?!</font>

43
00:02:01,510 --> 00:02:03,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I dislocate every joint</font>

44
00:02:03,850 --> 00:02:07,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and with Chakra, I can control
my softened body at will.</font>

45
00:02:08,980 --> 00:02:10,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Chakra...?</font>

46
00:02:13,690 --> 00:02:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can also squeeze until
your bones break.</font>

47
00:02:18,110 --> 00:02:21,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll rapidly tighten as long
as you don't give up.</font>

48
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:24,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what kind of
ninja tool you'll use...</font>

49
00:02:25,620 --> 00:02:28,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but if I keep doing this to your body,
it will make no difference.</font>

50
00:02:28,830 --> 00:02:31,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can break your neck right now.</font>

51
00:02:33,290 --> 00:02:34,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So hurry up and give up.</font>

52
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:37,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No.</font>

53
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to die?!</font>

54
00:02:41,050 --> 00:02:44,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot. You're the one who's
going to die.</font>

55
00:02:56,690 --> 00:02:58,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His neck is broken.</font>

56
00:02:59,110 --> 00:02:59,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

57
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How ridiculous...</font>

58
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:04,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Phew...</font>

59
00:03:06,200 --> 00:03:07,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot.</font>

60
00:03:07,950 --> 00:03:10,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I went a little overboard and
ended up killing you.</font>

61
00:03:16,750 --> 00:03:17,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What?</font>

62
00:03:18,460 --> 00:03:21,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, now it's my turn.</font>

63
00:03:30,480 --> 00:03:32,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This is a Puppet!</font>

64
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:42,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-That's the real body?</font>

65
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:46,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's... a Puppet Master...</font>

66
00:03:48,040 --> 00:03:51,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's controlling the puppet with
Chakra from his hand!</font>

67
00:04:03,180 --> 00:04:04,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">G-Give up...!</font>

68
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If your bones get crushed,
you'll be able to bend even more, huh?</font>

69
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:18,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For once, I was close to stopping
the match in the middle.</font>

70
00:04:23,200 --> 00:04:25,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The winner, by an inability
to continue the match by the opponent,</font>

71
00:04:25,740 --> 00:04:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is Kankuro.</font>

72
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:29,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Two against one is hitting
below the belt!</font>

73
00:04:29,990 --> 00:04:32,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that fair, Kakashi-sensei?!</font>

74
00:04:33,250 --> 00:04:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not particularly hitting
below the belt.</font>

75
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a puppet, after all.</font>

76
00:04:37,750 --> 00:04:39,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the Puppet Master Jutsu.</font>

77
00:04:40,210 --> 00:04:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's controlling the puppet with Chakra.</font>

78
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:44,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the same as using
a ninja tool... like shuriken.</font>

79
00:04:50,470 --> 00:04:52,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're all great Chakra users...</font>

80
00:04:54,060 --> 00:04:57,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought I could make it
kind of far with Chakra.</font>

81
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Rivals</font>

82
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Clash!</font>

83
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:05,400
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The Hearts of the Girls</font>

