<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">are in Serious Mode</font>

85
00:05:18,380 --> 00:05:19,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino...!</font>

86
