<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got the jitters,
don't you, Sakura?</font>

87
00:05:25,220 --> 00:05:25,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wha...?!</font>

88
00:05:29,550 --> 00:05:32,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even Sasuke-kun collapsed.</font>

89
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:36,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, it felt like it was because
