94
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quit? Who?</font>

95
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:19,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can hardly wait.</font>

96
00:06:28,650 --> 00:06:31,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro! Bring it on!</font>

97
00:06:35,490 --> 00:06:39,040
