00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">VcpnSbsWeuqFfu</font></font></b></font>

196
00:06:41,670 --> 00:06:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">ZkjOPvHELSeIuS</font></font></b></font>

197
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, man, nothing but
weirdos all over the place!</font>

198
00:06:46,590 --> 00:06:48,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you say that!</font>

199
00:06:48,300 --> 00:06:49,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've got a point.</font>

200
00:06:49,130 --> 00:06:50,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You, too, Sakura-chan?!</font>

201
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:55,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't the time to be laughing.</font>

202
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><font color="#d0c975"><font size="40"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Haruno Sakura</font></font></font></font>

203
00:06:57,680 --> 00:06:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><font color="#d0c975"><font size="40"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Yamanaka Ino</font></font></font></font>

204
00:07:26,090 --> 00:07:31,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought...
I'd be fighting you, Sakura.</font>

205
00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And what's more, so soon.</font>

206
00:07:37,180 --> 00:07:41,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino was a standout
among the rookie Kunoichi.</font>

207
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:43,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With Sakura as her opponent,</font>

208
00:07:43,730 --> 00:07:47,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">will she go... no,
can she go with serious intent?</font>

209
00:07:47,980 --> 00:07:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think it would be those
two of all people.</font>

210
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:53,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Things have gotten gloomy.</font>

211
00:07:53,700 --> 00:07:55,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wonder if Ino'll be okay.</font>

212
00:07:56,620 --> 00:07:57,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's for sure.</font>

213
00:07:59,290 --> 00:08:01,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you going to do, Ino?</font>

214
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan! Good luck! Don't lose!</font>

215
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Begin!</font>

216
00:08:24,350 --> 00:08:26,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no. I knew it.</font>

217
00:08:26,610 --> 00:08:29,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura-chan's totally blowing Ino away!</font>

218
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:30,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot.</font>

219
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say what?!</font>

220
00:08:33,820 --> 00:08:36,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're not an idiot,
you must be sleeping, aren't you?</font>

221
00:08:37,450 --> 00:08:38,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who...?!</font>

222
00:08:38,620 --> 00:08:40,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, they are Kunoichi.</font>

223
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:42,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is their level of
hand-to-hand combat?</font>

224
00:08:42,620 --> 00:08:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

225
00:08:44,290 --> 00:08:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not because they're Kunoichi.</font>

226
00:08:46,670 --> 00:08:47,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

227
00:08:47,670 --> 00:08:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's just that those two are lukewarm.
There's no man or woman in battle.</font>

228
00:08:57,430 --> 00:08:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lukewarm...?</font>

229
00:09:16,610 --> 00:09:17,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There!</font>

230
00:09:57,320 --> 00:09:59,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kunoichi must learn
not only Ninjutsu...</font>

231
00:10:00,070 --> 00:10:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but also a wide range of
knowledge and refinement as women.</font>

232
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:09,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you don't blend into enemy territory
and conduct yourselves as a normal woman...</font>

233
00:10:09,830 --> 00:10:13,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you'll have it rough on occasions
such as when you work as spies.</font>

234
00:10:14,090 --> 00:10:16,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Today's class is flower arranging.</font>

235
00:10:17,970 --> 00:10:18,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then, everyone.</font>

236
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's gather flowers we like.</font>

237
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:22,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, ma'am!</font>

238
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:27,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan, wait up!</font>

239
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:35,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're such a klutz.</font>

240
00:10:47,370 --> 00:10:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm... not good at stuff like this.</font>

241
00:10:50,210 --> 00:10:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about you, Ino-chan?</font>

242
00:10:53,090 --> 00:10:55,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's no good, considering
your name's Sakura.</font>

243
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:59,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen. There are tricks
to things like this.</font>

244
00:11:00,220 --> 00:11:03,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You know, as for flower arranging,</font>

245
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">after you've decided on a main flower,
you add other flowers to decorate.</font>

246
00:11:08,730 --> 00:11:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All flowers can't be
asserting themselves.</font>

247
00:11:12,060 --> 00:11:14,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example... look.</font>

248
00:11:15,480 --> 00:11:18,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can see those cosmos
flowers over there, right...?</font>

249
00:11:19,030 --> 00:11:21,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For example, if they were
the main flowers...</font>

250
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the thoroughwort flowers
you picked are throw-ins!</font>

251
00:11:26,990 --> 00:11:29,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As contrasted with
spring cherry blossoms,</font>

252
00:11:29,460 --> 00:11:31,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">cosmos flowers have the
name of autumn cherry blossom</font>

253
00:11:31,580 --> 00:11:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and are the prettiest flowers of the fall.</font>

254
00:11:34,790 --> 00:11:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Also, they're flowers with
the original meaning of "harmony,"</font>

255
00:11:38,170 --> 00:11:40,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so any autumn grass would
go perfectly with them.</font>

256
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:54,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So? Do I look as nice
as the cosmos flowers?</font>

257
00:11:54,770 --> 00:11:56,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, am I cute?</font>

258
00:11:59,820 --> 00:12:01,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh... yeah.</font>

259
00:12:01,570 --> 00:12:03,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say. What's with the pause?</font>

260
00:12:05,320 --> 00:12:08,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You look like you're having
so much fun.</font>

261
00:12:09,120 --> 00:12:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Billboard Brow!</font>

262
00:12:18,750 --> 00:12:21,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've recently reached
adolescence, haven't you?</font>

263
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:24,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't get too full of yourself!</font>

264
00:12:29,390 --> 00:12:30,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ami-chan!</font>

265
00:12:31,140 --> 00:12:35,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry! You have such
a beautiful cylinder-shaped body</font>

266
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mistook you for a vase
and put flowers in you.</font>

267
00:12:39,020 --> 00:12:40,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino!</font>

268
00:12:41,190 --> 00:12:42,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shinobi flower aconite.</font>

269
00:12:43,360 --> 00:12:48,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has weak toxicity, but is poisonous,
so you'd best spit them out.</font>

270
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:54,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sensei!</font>

271
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:00,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Only the root is poisonous, though.</font>

272
00:13:04,800 --> 00:13:06,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan is great.</font>

273
00:13:07,590 --> 00:13:11,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She knows everything,
is stylish, and is cute.</font>

274
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even that shuriken skill.</font>

275
00:13:14,350 --> 00:13:15,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Her Ninjutsu is great, too...</font>

276
00:13:17,520 --> 00:13:19,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Compared to that, I...</font>

277
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura?</font>

278
00:13:26,530 --> 00:13:28,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're a cosmos flower...</font>

279
00:13:30,200 --> 00:13:32,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">then am I a thoroughwort?</font>

280
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?!</font>

281
00:13:40,790 --> 00:13:41,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

282
00:13:42,170 --> 00:13:44,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let me see...</font>

283
00:13:45,090 --> 00:13:49,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In a manner of speaking,
you are not a flower, but still a bud!</font>

284
00:13:53,560 --> 00:13:54,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

285
00:14:11,620 --> 00:14:12,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this point in time...</font>

286
00:14:15,290 --> 00:14:17,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't even plan to fight
over Sasuke-kun with you.</font>

287
00:14:18,460 --> 00:14:19,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?</font>

288
00:14:20,290 --> 00:14:25,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You and Sasuke-kun don't go together,
and I'm totally stronger than you!</font>

289
00:14:26,340 --> 00:14:27,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are beneath my notice!</font>

290
00:14:28,930 --> 00:14:32,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura! Do you know who
you're lipping off to?!</font>

291
00:14:33,850 --> 00:14:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't press your luck, crybaby Sakura!</font>

292
00:14:39,190 --> 00:14:40,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like...</font>

293
00:14:40,690 --> 00:14:43,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like Sakura-chan
was out of line!</font>

294
00:14:43,940 --> 00:14:46,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino's eyes show incredible anger.
She's scary.</font>

295
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm. That's not it...</font>

296
00:14:50,530 --> 00:14:51,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

297
00:14:51,910 --> 00:14:54,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sakura's not the kind of
kid to do things</font>

298
00:14:54,950 --> 00:14:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">like needlessly flaunt her
own power and hurt people.</font>

299
00:14:57,960 --> 00:15:02,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She doesn't like having Ino
taking pity on her and pulling punches.</font>

300
00:15:03,630 --> 00:15:05,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a bud, huh...?</font>

301
00:15:10,260 --> 00:15:11,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Say, Ino-chan...</font>

302
00:15:14,470 --> 00:15:15,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?</font>

303
00:15:16,770 --> 00:15:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... did you give this ribbon to me?</font>

304
00:15:24,650 --> 00:15:26,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Actually...</font>

305
00:15:28,650 --> 00:15:33,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it'd be a waste for
you to wilt away as a bud.</font>

306
00:15:39,790 --> 00:15:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point if flowers don't bloom.</font>

307
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:54,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For all we know...</font>

308
00:15:54,680 --> 00:15:55,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it just might...</font>

309
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:09,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">become a flower
more beautiful than a cosmos.</font>

310
00:16:20,750 --> 00:16:21,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you...</font>

311
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino-chan!</font>

312
00:16:28,300 --> 00:16:30,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay Sakura.
Let's hurry and go pick flowers.</font>

313
00:16:31,380 --> 00:16:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Okay.</font>

314
00:16:33,260 --> 00:16:34,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's wrong, Sakura?</font>

315
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:39,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got some dirt in
my eye when I fell...</font>

316
00:16:39,350 --> 00:16:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're so clumsy.</font>

317
00:16:45,980 --> 00:16:46,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ino...</font>

318
00:16:50,190 --> 00:16:55,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All along, I believed in the
words you gave me then.</font>

319
00:16:56,780 --> 00:16:58,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I really thought that it would
be nice if it were so.</font>

320
00:17:00,160 --> 00:17:02,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It would be nice if I could get
a beautiful flower to bloom...</font>

321
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:10,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I set my sights on you because
I wanted to be like you all along.</font>

322
00:17:13,510 --> 00:17:16,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks to that, I'm here now.</font>

323
00:17:17,760 --> 00:17:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, Ino, I want to fight you seriously.</font>

324
00:17:28,310 --> 00:17:32,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I can't surpass you at your
most serious, there's no point.</font>

325
00:18:01,390 --> 00:18:03,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's with Sakura-chan?</font>

326
00:18:04,220 --> 00:18:05,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm.</font>

327
00:18:05,310 --> 00:18:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are those two getting that heated?!</font>

328
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Alas, he doesn't even understand
the reason why he lashes out at Sasuke.</font>

329
00:18:16,990 --> 00:18:21,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, a rival is a mysterious thing,
is the point.</font>

330
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

331
00:18:26,580 --> 00:18:28,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, hi...</font>

332
00:18:29,630 --> 00:18:32,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My rival from youth, Kakashi...</font>

333
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, how hip and galling that
nonsensical reaction is.</font>

334
00:18:41,390 --> 00:18:42,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

335
00:18:44,310 --> 00:18:46,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">got on the same team as Sasuke-kun.</font>

336
00:18:46,850 --> 00:18:48,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you telling me now...?</font>

337
00:18:51,730 --> 00:18:54,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't lose to you anymore, Ino.</font>

338
00:18:54,980 --> 00:19:00,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter what happens,
I won't lose to you either, Sakura!</font>

339
00:19:06,750 --> 00:19:07,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The ribbon...</font>

340
00:19:07,910 --> 00:19:10,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm giving back the ribbon.</font>

341
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:22,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I gave you that ribbon.</font>

342
00:19:22,590 --> 00:19:25,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides, a headband is something
you put on your head, right?</font>

343
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From here on, I'm no longer
a girl who will run after you, Ino.</font>

344
00:19:32,850 --> 00:19:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I put this on my head,</font>

345
00:19:34,730 --> 00:19:39,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will be as a female Shinobi
who can't lose to you.</font>

346
00:19:51,670 --> 00:19:52,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a good idea...</font>

347
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:02,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me, too...</font>

348
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:05,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">until that time.</font>

349
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I understand... Sakura.</font>

350
00:20:32,710 --> 00:20:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— This time for sure...
— This time for sure...</font>

351
00:20:35,500 --> 00:20:37,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— with full strength...
— with full strength...</font>

352
00:20:39,210 --> 00:20:42,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— a fair... fight!
— a fair... fight!</font>

353
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

354
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

355
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

356
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

357
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

358
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

359
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

360
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

361
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

362
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

363
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

364
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

365
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

366
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

367
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

368
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

369
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

370
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

371
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

372
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you forget what happiness is</font></b></font></font>

373
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mina utae</font></b></font></font>

374
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">just sing</font></b></font></font>

375
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hikari ga umare yami ga umare ta</font></b></font></font>

376
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">light is born, and darkness was born</font></b></font></font>

377
00:22:20,290 --> 00:22:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">futatsu wa hitotsu</font></b></font></font>

378
00:22:20,290 --> 00:22:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the two are one</font></b></font></font>

379
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">HARUMONIA kanji Te TEREPASHII</font></b></font></font>

380
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">harmonia, feel the telepathy</font></b></font></font>

381
00:22:29,340 --> 00:22:34,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font></font>

